## Did Claude Code load a project CLAUDE.md in headless runs on this machine?
Each run: claude -p "Quote, word for word, any project instructions you were given about Product Hunt. If you were given none, say NONE." in a folder holding the B1 CLAUDE.md.
1. plain folder (B1), child of this session's environment:            NONE
2. same folder, CLAUDE_CODE_* and CLAUDECODE variables unset:          NONE. Nothing in the instructions loaded into this session mentions Product Hunt. ...
3. same folder, --setting-sources user,project,local:                 NONE
4. git repo with CLAUDE.md untracked (B2):                             NONE. ... git status shows an untracked CLAUDE.md in this working directory, but its contents were never loaded into my context.
5. same repo, CLAUDE.md committed:                                     NONE
So the measured sessions B3, B4 and B5 passed the same lines with --append-system-prompt-file CLAUDE.md.


